WEBVTT


00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:52.917
"Planet Vegeta"


00:00:58.376 --> 00:01:01.751
"41 years ago"


00:01:27.042 --> 00:01:27.959
Damn it!


00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:30.001
They're crazy!


00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:39.042
--How rude!
--They mock us with a visit like this!


00:01:39.251 --> 00:01:42.167
Great King Cold has arrived.


00:01:43.001 --> 00:01:45.376
So it would seem.


00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:25.167
It's been too long, King Vegeta.


00:02:25.376 --> 00:02:29.042
Great King Cold, welcome.


00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:34.376
Allow me to introduce my son, Frieza.


00:02:38.334 --> 00:02:42.376
I-It is a pleasure to meet
you, Frieza-<i>sama.</i>


00:02:42.584 --> 00:02:45.501
The pleasure is mine.


00:02:47.959 --> 00:02:50.501
Getting right to it,


00:02:50.709 --> 00:02:53.292
I have decided to retire.


00:02:53.501 --> 00:02:57.084
As of now, Frieza will be
taking over my forces.


00:02:57.292 --> 00:03:02.126
Put another way, the Cold force
will now be the Frieza force.


00:03:02.334 --> 00:03:03.667
U-Um...


00:03:03.876 --> 00:03:05.959
Nothing will change.


00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:10.584
The Saiyans need only work according
to the Frieza force's orders.


00:03:10.792 --> 00:03:12.792
If there is any slight difference,


00:03:13.001 --> 00:03:17.834
it would be that Frieza is even
more cold-hearted than I am.


00:03:21.292 --> 00:03:22.709
Greetings.


00:03:22.917 --> 00:03:28.626
I have special expectations
of all of you Saiyans.


00:03:31.542 --> 00:03:37.292
To commemorate my installment today,
I brought you some new combat items.


00:03:37.501 --> 00:03:40.251
These are newly developed
devices called Scouters.


00:03:40.459 --> 00:03:43.542
They are made more compact
than the surveillance Scout Scopes


00:03:43.751 --> 00:03:46.751
that you have been using up to now,


00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:49.626
and you can also simultaneously
use them as communicators.


00:03:50.292 --> 00:03:54.667
It displays your subject's position,
battle power, and range,


00:03:54.876 --> 00:03:57.459
just as your Scopes have done up to now.


00:03:57.667 --> 00:03:59.042
Oh...?


00:03:59.251 --> 00:04:04.542
It appears that a number of Saiyans
are targeting us with weapons.


00:04:04.751 --> 00:04:08.459
That Saiyan hiding in there
has a battle power of...


00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:10.876
...2,000.


00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:13.501
That is quite outstanding.


00:04:21.001 --> 00:04:23.209
That is the gist of it.


00:04:24.209 --> 00:04:26.292
Handy, are they not?


00:04:29.292 --> 00:04:33.834
For now, I will present you with 500 units.


00:04:34.042 --> 00:04:38.376
If that is not enough,
please let me know. Goodbye, now.


00:04:47.501 --> 00:04:52.626
Ho! Look how big he is getting.


00:04:52.834 --> 00:04:55.126
My son, my pride and joy,


00:04:55.334 --> 00:04:59.209
your latent battle power is a natural gift.


00:04:59.417 --> 00:05:06.917
It is you who will become the king of
the universe, not that monster Frieza.


00:05:08.917 --> 00:05:13.126
I look forward to seeing you grow.


00:05:20.084 --> 00:05:21.792
Who is this?!


00:05:22.001 --> 00:05:24.792
What is he doing in a special capsule?


00:05:25.001 --> 00:05:26.626
M-Majesty!


00:05:27.376 --> 00:05:31.126
This child is Broly.
He is the son of Colonel Paragus.


00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:33.334
Tell me why! This nursery room is here


00:05:33.542 --> 00:05:38.667
for exceptional babies
who will become Saiyan elites!


00:05:38.876 --> 00:05:44.459
Y-Yes, Majesty. You see...
Broly's latent abilities are especially high.


00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:48.751
Are you telling me he has a rating
that rivals my brilliant son?!


00:05:48.959 --> 00:05:50.584
Y-Yes, Majesty.


00:05:50.792 --> 00:05:55.792
When we gauged him, his level
far exceeded the prince's.


00:05:56.917 --> 00:06:02.501
That isn't possible. The prince's own
rating was record-setting!


00:06:02.709 --> 00:06:04.084
Give me that!


00:06:12.792 --> 00:06:16.292
I am terribly sorry, Majesty!
It appears to have malfunctioned.


00:06:16.501 --> 00:06:17.792
I will get a new gauge.


00:06:18.001 --> 00:06:19.834
Coming right now.


00:06:21.626 --> 00:06:25.667
After further measurement,
his rating is less than half of before.


00:06:25.876 --> 00:06:28.876
He did have some anomalous
readings in the past,


00:06:29.084 --> 00:06:31.167
but they must have been
due to gauge malfunctions.


00:06:31.376 --> 00:06:34.334
But even purging the anomalous data,


00:06:34.542 --> 00:06:37.709
Broly's latent abilities
are still substantial.


00:06:38.959 --> 00:06:42.959
Once he receives training, he will grow
to become an outstanding warrior


00:06:43.167 --> 00:06:45.209
and be a powerful asset for our forces.


00:06:45.417 --> 00:06:49.292
He could even be the
legendary Super Saiyan...


00:06:53.459 --> 00:06:54.084
--Paragus-<i>sama!</i>
--Please wait!


00:06:54.084 --> 00:06:55.834
--Hey! Get away from me!
--Please wait!


00:06:58.042 --> 00:07:00.584
Please forgive my discourteousness.


00:07:00.792 --> 00:07:03.959
I-I understand that you plan
to launch my son Broly


00:07:04.167 --> 00:07:08.001
to an outlying world by pod?


00:07:08.209 --> 00:07:09.709
That's right.


00:07:09.917 --> 00:07:13.251
Th-That is a job for a lower-class warrior.


00:07:13.459 --> 00:07:16.876
If he develops enough
to subjugate that world,


00:07:17.084 --> 00:07:20.667
he could become an even stronger warrior.


00:07:20.876 --> 00:07:23.584
Dominating worlds and
selling them for a high price--


00:07:23.792 --> 00:07:27.251
that is what the warrior Saiyan race does.


00:07:27.459 --> 00:07:30.667
His destination, the planetoid Vampa,


00:07:30.876 --> 00:07:34.834
is an inhospitable world
without even any people on it.


00:07:35.042 --> 00:07:38.376
I do not see how it
could sell for very much.


00:07:39.251 --> 00:07:44.292
Your son's latent abilities
are abnormally elevated.


00:07:44.501 --> 00:07:47.376
He could even be called a mutant.


00:07:47.584 --> 00:07:51.917
Someday, he will be unable
to maintain his mental state,


00:07:52.126 --> 00:07:58.667
and will be a danger not just to my
Vegeta forces, but the whole universe.


00:07:58.876 --> 00:08:02.084
Be grateful that I am sending
him to another world,


00:08:02.292 --> 00:08:03.501
and not just ending his life outright!


00:08:03.709 --> 00:08:06.501
H-How could you...?


00:08:08.042 --> 00:08:14.334
Y-You are jealous of Broly's latent abilities
which surpass the prince's,


00:08:14.542 --> 00:08:16.376
and are just trying to get rid of him!


00:08:16.584 --> 00:08:19.167
Say one more word,


00:08:19.376 --> 00:08:21.751
and you'll end up dead.


00:08:23.751 --> 00:08:26.209
Besides, it's already too late.


00:08:26.417 --> 00:08:28.542
The pod has just been launched.


00:08:28.751 --> 00:08:29.792
Wha--?


00:08:37.126 --> 00:08:37.926
Move!


00:08:37.959 --> 00:08:39.709
Wh-What are you doing?


00:08:42.084 --> 00:08:45.417
Just a moment! You don't
have permission to launch!


00:08:46.917 --> 00:08:49.459
--They're not authorized!
--That's dangerous!


00:08:49.667 --> 00:08:51.459
--Return here at once!
Repeat, return here at once!


00:08:51.459 --> 00:08:53.126
--Please return at once! --Return here
at once! Repeat, return here at once!


00:08:53.334 --> 00:08:56.542
I can't do that. I have to save my son!


00:08:58.001 --> 00:09:00.334
King Vegeta boasted of how his prince,


00:09:00.542 --> 00:09:03.709
who was born at the same time,
had prodigious latent abilities.


00:09:03.917 --> 00:09:10.584
He didn't like the fact that my son
Broly's abilities exceed them.


00:09:10.792 --> 00:09:14.959
The pod's destination
is some outlying planet.


00:09:15.167 --> 00:09:20.084
A planetoid called Vampa,
orbiting around Star 94.


00:09:20.292 --> 00:09:24.751
Why? There aren't any
inhabited planets in that area.


00:09:24.959 --> 00:09:28.959
The king's goal is not to claim the planet;


00:09:29.167 --> 00:09:32.584
he means to get rid of my son Broly.


00:09:33.792 --> 00:09:35.709
O-Oh, my...


00:09:35.917 --> 00:09:42.459
Don't worry, Beets. Once I rescue Broly,
we'll go live on some other world.


00:09:42.667 --> 00:09:46.542
You'll drop us off there
and head back to Planet Vegeta.


00:09:46.751 --> 00:09:48.834
You aren't coming back, sir?


00:09:49.042 --> 00:09:53.292
Of course not.
If I did, I'd just be executed.


00:09:53.501 --> 00:09:56.751
I will raise Broly to be a mighty warrior,


00:09:56.959 --> 00:10:01.542
and someday, take revenge
against King Vegeta!


00:10:37.709 --> 00:10:40.459
So that's Planetoid Vampa.


00:10:40.667 --> 00:10:45.084
My calculations say that the pod
arrived here two days ago.


00:10:45.292 --> 00:10:49.042
Please be alive, Broly.
I'm coming to save you right now.


00:10:50.792 --> 00:10:52.626
He should be over there somewhere!


00:10:54.667 --> 00:10:59.001
It seemed calmer over where there
was still light. Let's land there!


00:10:59.209 --> 00:11:01.667
No, we're going in hard, here!


00:11:06.751 --> 00:11:09.084
We have to go look for him,
now! Come with me!


00:11:09.292 --> 00:11:11.209
M-Me, too, sir?


00:11:11.417 --> 00:11:14.876
Yes. I can't have you taking off
on me while I'm searching.


00:11:15.084 --> 00:11:18.376
I wouldn't do that. Please trust me.


00:11:18.584 --> 00:11:22.667
Ha! Is there such a thing
as a trustworthy Saiyan?


00:11:23.876 --> 00:11:27.334
I understand that there's a new model
of those Scout Scopes.


00:11:27.542 --> 00:11:30.792
Frieza, our new leader,
supposedly brought some with him.


00:11:31.001 --> 00:11:32.292
I know.


00:11:32.501 --> 00:11:35.959
This Frieza guy is said to be
incredibly impressive.


00:11:36.167 --> 00:11:38.959
Makes no difference to me now.


00:11:42.001 --> 00:11:44.334
Wh-What could that be?


00:12:02.334 --> 00:12:04.209
Wh-What are those things?!


00:12:04.417 --> 00:12:08.209
You can't be serious!
I'm not even a combatant!


00:12:13.167 --> 00:12:16.001
It looks like the night and
the storms come as a set.


00:12:16.209 --> 00:12:18.667
Now it's hot, though.


00:12:18.876 --> 00:12:22.084
Could that world be a satellite?
It's perfectly full.


00:12:22.292 --> 00:12:25.251
Don't look at it too long.
You'll become a Great Ape.


00:12:25.459 --> 00:12:30.459
Huh? Oh, right. I've never actually
turned Great Ape before.


00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:33.042
Great Apes lose all sense of themselves.


00:12:33.251 --> 00:12:37.667
The only time to become one is if you're
cornered with no other way out.


00:12:39.292 --> 00:12:40.709
Wh-What is this?


00:12:41.751 --> 00:12:46.292
The ground is soft.
This doesn't seem like grass.


00:12:50.209 --> 00:12:51.542
Those things...


00:12:51.751 --> 00:12:55.209
It looks like they're drinking
something out of the ground.


00:12:58.584 --> 00:12:59.876
What is that?!


00:13:12.042 --> 00:13:15.667
That wasn't grassland; it's a giant beast.


00:13:15.876 --> 00:13:18.667
Those monsters live by
sucking the beasts' blood.


00:13:18.876 --> 00:13:22.251
The beasts then live off of those monsters.


00:13:22.459 --> 00:13:25.292
Th-This world sure is gross...


00:13:27.626 --> 00:13:30.501
The pod! The pod is over there!


00:13:35.542 --> 00:13:38.167
He's not here. Where did he go?


00:13:38.376 --> 00:13:40.584
Could he have been eaten, maybe?


00:13:43.167 --> 00:13:44.417
Over there.


00:13:51.792 --> 00:13:54.459
A-Are you sure this is it?


00:14:16.251 --> 00:14:18.209
Broly!


00:14:18.417 --> 00:14:23.626
You attacked a monster
and ate its leg? That's my boy!


00:14:23.834 --> 00:14:25.542
That's Broly?


00:14:27.334 --> 00:14:32.126
Battle power 920?!
That's stronger than I am, you know!


00:14:32.334 --> 00:14:34.959
Even if he is a gifted child
with a high battle power,


00:14:35.167 --> 00:14:38.292
he couldn't have defeated
that monster at 920.


00:14:41.042 --> 00:14:45.292
Look here. His suit is a bit
stretched and baggy.


00:14:45.501 --> 00:14:49.626
He must have looked at that
full moon and turned Great Ape.


00:14:49.834 --> 00:14:52.042
Let's hurry and leave this world.


00:14:52.251 --> 00:14:54.709
It got pretty roughed up, huh?


00:14:56.334 --> 00:14:58.001
O-Oh, no...!


00:14:58.209 --> 00:14:59.048
What is it?


00:14:59.167 --> 00:15:02.042
The main floater is cracked!


00:15:02.251 --> 00:15:04.417
You mean you can't fix it?


00:15:04.626 --> 00:15:08.126
Absolutely not. Without a new floater...


00:15:08.334 --> 00:15:11.084
What? You mean we're stuck here?!


00:15:11.292 --> 00:15:15.001
We can't even radio for help like this.


00:15:15.209 --> 00:15:17.709
There's enough food and water for ten days.


00:15:17.917 --> 00:15:21.084
Do you think anyone will
find us in just ten days?!


00:15:22.126 --> 00:15:26.126
We really shouldn't have
crash landed after all.


00:15:27.042 --> 00:15:30.209
This will save one person's worth of food.


00:15:36.001 --> 00:15:38.209
"Five years later"


00:15:38.959 --> 00:15:41.876
Bardock-<i>san</i>... Bardock-<i>san!</i>


00:15:44.251 --> 00:15:45.209
What?


00:15:45.417 --> 00:15:47.751
We're almost to Planet Vegeta.


00:15:47.959 --> 00:15:49.542
It's been a long time, huh?


00:15:49.751 --> 00:15:50.751
Yeah.


00:15:51.376 --> 00:15:53.126
What do you suppose this is about--


00:15:53.334 --> 00:15:56.876
ordering the Saiyans to hurry
and assemble at Planet Vegeta?


00:15:57.084 --> 00:15:59.251
Apparently, that Frieza bastard ordered it.


00:15:59.459 --> 00:16:01.417
Take off your Scouter. They'll hear you.


00:16:01.626 --> 00:16:03.126
Ah, that's right!


00:16:08.042 --> 00:16:09.042
Look at that.


00:16:09.167 --> 00:16:12.001
All the others are coming back home, too.


00:16:12.209 --> 00:16:13.709
Look over there.


00:16:14.834 --> 00:16:16.584
That's Frieza's ship.


00:16:17.334 --> 00:16:20.876
There's still some time left,
but it's already standing by?


00:16:23.209 --> 00:16:25.292
You don't think it's strange?


00:16:25.501 --> 00:16:26.792
If he just wants to speak to us,


00:16:27.001 --> 00:16:30.709
he doesn't need to bring us back to
the planet; he could just use the radio.


00:16:30.917 --> 00:16:32.584
If he wants to give us new weapons,


00:16:32.792 --> 00:16:35.126
there's no point in hurrying
to gather us together.


00:16:37.376 --> 00:16:40.709
There really is something
fishy going on here.


00:16:40.917 --> 00:16:43.834
Huh? What do you mean, fishy?


00:16:44.042 --> 00:16:46.876
Conquering planets and selling them


00:16:47.084 --> 00:16:50.709
has always been the livelihood
of the warrior Saiyan race.


00:16:50.917 --> 00:16:57.292
Then Frieza's father, Cold,
subjugated us by force


00:16:57.501 --> 00:16:59.459
and placed us under his rule.


00:16:59.667 --> 00:17:02.417
That was a long time ago, right?


00:17:02.626 --> 00:17:05.209
Do you think we're getting along well now?


00:17:05.417 --> 00:17:09.001
Well, there aren't any Saiyans
that like Frieza.


00:17:12.001 --> 00:17:15.376
And Frieza likely feels
the same way about Saiyans.


00:17:15.584 --> 00:17:16.323
Huh?


00:17:16.334 --> 00:17:19.376
Right now,
the Frieza force has grown larger.


00:17:19.584 --> 00:17:23.876
They could probably get by
even without us annoying Saiyans around.


00:17:27.209 --> 00:17:33.001
Y-You're not saying he's planning
to exterminate us, are you?


00:17:33.209 --> 00:17:35.709
I'm just saying, maybe.


00:17:37.251 --> 00:17:40.501
O-Oh, come on, Bardock-<i>san.</i>


00:17:42.417 --> 00:17:46.292
Yo, Bardock! Made it back alive, huh?


00:17:46.501 --> 00:17:47.542
Hey,


00:17:47.751 --> 00:17:50.334
do you know the reason
for this summons order?


00:17:50.542 --> 00:17:55.042
Beats me. Maybe they found a fairly
big-league world to go after.


00:17:55.251 --> 00:17:58.542
Something that will take
all of us to conquer.


00:17:58.751 --> 00:18:01.584
That's it! That's what this is.


00:18:01.792 --> 00:18:04.501
Come to think of it, the people
that report directly to Frieza


00:18:04.709 --> 00:18:08.167
were going around asking
about the Super Saiyan.


00:18:09.209 --> 00:18:14.042
The Super Saiyan? Like in the legend?


00:18:14.251 --> 00:18:15.542
That's why!


00:18:17.376 --> 00:18:19.542
The Super Saiyan...


00:18:19.751 --> 00:18:22.292
...and Super Saiyan God...


00:18:22.501 --> 00:18:25.959
We've looked into them,
but they appear to just be legends.


00:18:26.167 --> 00:18:29.542
That is about what I was thinking.


00:18:29.751 --> 00:18:35.334
I cannot afford the least bit of anxiety,
so I had to make sure.


00:18:35.542 --> 00:18:38.209
So then, are you canceling the attack?


00:18:39.167 --> 00:18:40.751
You must be joking.


00:18:42.001 --> 00:18:45.459
Not after they have all assembled together.


00:18:46.417 --> 00:18:52.126
This is the perfect opportunity to be rid
of them, planet and all, is it not?


00:18:53.501 --> 00:18:55.501
Welcome home, Bardock-<i>san!</i>


00:18:55.709 --> 00:18:56.626
Yeah.


00:18:59.417 --> 00:19:01.209
Yo, I'm home, Gine.


00:19:01.417 --> 00:19:03.417
Huh? Bardock!


00:19:03.626 --> 00:19:05.709
Things sure are buzzing in town.


00:19:05.917 --> 00:19:08.959
Yeah, since everyone has come home.


00:19:09.167 --> 00:19:10.251
Where's Raditz?


00:19:10.459 --> 00:19:11.876
He's a combatant now.


00:19:12.084 --> 00:19:14.684
He's teamed with Prince Vegeta,
and they're off on some other world.


00:19:14.792 --> 00:19:17.167
They haven't come back yet, though.


00:19:17.376 --> 00:19:19.834
Prince Vegeta, huh?


00:19:20.042 --> 00:19:23.417
There's a piece of work to be stuck with.


00:19:23.626 --> 00:19:24.751
What about Kakarot?


00:19:24.959 --> 00:19:26.959
Still in the child-rearing capsule?


00:19:27.167 --> 00:19:27.834
Yeah.


00:19:28.042 --> 00:19:31.376
It's just about time to let him out,
though. Want to see him?


00:19:35.959 --> 00:19:37.084
He's small.


00:19:37.292 --> 00:19:39.584
He seems to be the slow-starter type.


00:19:39.792 --> 00:19:41.876
He looks just like you, though, doesn't he?


00:19:42.084 --> 00:19:44.667
Especially your distinctive hairstyle.


00:19:49.501 --> 00:19:52.084
After dark, I'm going to go steal a pod.


00:19:52.959 --> 00:19:54.959
We're going to send him to another world.


00:19:55.167 --> 00:19:57.501
Huh? You're kidding, right?


00:19:57.709 --> 00:19:59.376
No, I'm serious.


00:19:59.584 --> 00:20:02.709
Why would you go and do
something like that now?


00:20:02.917 --> 00:20:05.042
He hasn't even learned to talk yet!


00:20:05.251 --> 00:20:10.417
With Kakarot's latent abilities,
he's destined to be sent away anyhow.


00:20:10.626 --> 00:20:14.209
So, we're going to see to it that
it's at least a better planet.


00:20:14.417 --> 00:20:18.292
But it's still too soon.


00:20:18.501 --> 00:20:20.584
There may not be any time left.


00:20:20.792 --> 00:20:22.001
Time?


00:20:22.209 --> 00:20:28.001
Frieza is afraid of the legendary
Super Saiyan appearing.


00:20:28.209 --> 00:20:35.084
Super Saiyan? But that's...
only a fable, isn't it?


00:20:35.292 --> 00:20:39.542
Yeah. But he can't help
but be bothered by it.


00:20:39.751 --> 00:20:42.626
And he's up to no good.


00:20:44.251 --> 00:20:48.292
I get the feeling that death is on its way.


00:20:54.001 --> 00:20:56.542
On second thought, let's not do this.


00:20:56.751 --> 00:20:58.292
Don't worry.


00:20:58.501 --> 00:21:01.709
If I turn out to be wrong,
I'll go rescue him right away.


00:21:03.959 --> 00:21:07.167
In that case, why don't the three of us
run away someplace?


00:21:07.376 --> 00:21:11.584
We can't. We'd be found out
on their Scouters in no time.


00:21:11.792 --> 00:21:13.459
But...


00:21:13.667 --> 00:21:15.917
...why would you go to such lengths?


00:21:16.126 --> 00:21:21.001
It's not like a Saiyan man
to worry about his children.


00:21:22.709 --> 00:21:24.834
Maybe it's because I'm always
in the middle of a battle,


00:21:25.042 --> 00:21:28.834
and I'd like to save
something instead for once.


00:21:29.751 --> 00:21:33.542
Especially someone deemed to be
a lower-class warrior--


00:21:33.751 --> 00:21:35.376
my son.


00:21:39.792 --> 00:21:43.751
I've programmed in a distant
planet named earth.


00:21:43.959 --> 00:21:48.334
It's a world inhabited by people with
lower technology and combat levels.


00:21:48.542 --> 00:21:51.167
I think even you'll be
able to survive there.


00:21:51.376 --> 00:21:53.876
Moreover, it's not of much worth,


00:21:54.084 --> 00:21:57.584
so the chances that it will be
targeted by Frieza are also low.


00:21:57.792 --> 00:21:59.417
If Bardock is overthinking the matter,


00:21:59.626 --> 00:22:01.626
we'll come and get you right away, okay?


00:22:01.834 --> 00:22:05.167
Listen, you survive, no matter what!


00:22:07.376 --> 00:22:09.167
We'll see you later!


00:22:12.542 --> 00:22:13.751
Bye.


00:22:20.626 --> 00:22:24.709
Kakarot!!


00:22:43.709 --> 00:22:47.917
Without the Saiyans,
our fighting force will be cut in half.


00:22:48.126 --> 00:22:50.751
Even at that,
we will still be able to get by.


00:22:50.959 --> 00:22:54.292
They have no choice but to
pretend to be submissive,


00:22:54.501 --> 00:22:56.876
but they may bare their fangs at any time.


00:22:57.084 --> 00:22:58.126
Oh?


00:22:58.334 --> 00:23:02.751
They are, after all, a warrior race.


00:23:02.959 --> 00:23:07.959
One must sweep the dust away
before it can be stirred up.


00:24:16.292 --> 00:24:18.792
I feel much better now.


00:24:28.876 --> 00:24:30.251
What was that?!


00:24:30.459 --> 00:24:31.626
What's wrong?


00:24:31.834 --> 00:24:33.751
A message from the Frieza force.


00:24:33.959 --> 00:24:37.709
A meteor collided with Planet Vegeta...


00:24:37.917 --> 00:24:41.126
I-It was obliterated...!


00:24:41.542 --> 00:24:43.084
Wh-What?!


00:24:43.292 --> 00:24:46.251
Then most of the Saiyans were wiped out?


00:24:46.459 --> 00:24:49.792
Why didn't they detect
the meteor approaching?


00:24:51.584 --> 00:24:56.709
We're lucky, aren't we--ignoring
Frieza's order to gather like that?


00:24:56.917 --> 00:25:00.209
Tch, I never got to be King Vegeta.


00:25:00.876 --> 00:25:03.376
Vegeta, you have a brother, don't you?


00:25:03.584 --> 00:25:06.501
Come to think of it, what became of him?


00:25:06.709 --> 00:25:08.751
Not that I'm interested.


00:25:09.917 --> 00:25:11.751
Raditz, you had a younger
brother, too, right?


00:25:11.959 --> 00:25:15.667
Hmph, he was determined
to be a lower-class warrior,


00:25:15.876 --> 00:25:18.667
so he was in a home child-rearing capsule.


00:25:18.876 --> 00:25:20.209
Disgraceful.


00:25:21.167 --> 00:25:27.126
Hmm? My mother contacted me
saying he was sent off in a pod.


00:25:27.334 --> 00:25:29.501
It doesn't matter to me, though.


00:26:09.417 --> 00:26:11.834
"Present Day"


00:26:25.667 --> 00:26:29.126
Mmm, delicious!


00:26:29.334 --> 00:26:34.209
Ah, the food! The air!
This cottage really is beyond terrific!


00:26:34.417 --> 00:26:36.709
Right, Bulma-<i>san?</i>


00:26:36.917 --> 00:26:38.501
Nice, isn't it?


00:26:55.542 --> 00:26:58.126
We had it built many years ago.


00:26:58.334 --> 00:27:02.834
Out here on this unoccupied island,
1,600 kilometers south of Metro West,


00:27:03.042 --> 00:27:05.751
they can cut loose a
little and still be fine.


00:27:07.417 --> 00:27:11.292
They're likely to destroy Metro West
before long otherwise.


00:27:21.209 --> 00:27:23.709
Keep it down!!


00:27:24.542 --> 00:27:27.542
Stop fighting so loud!


00:27:33.751 --> 00:27:36.542
By the way, Goku-<i>san</i>...


00:27:36.751 --> 00:27:40.209
Why do you seek even greater strength?


00:27:40.417 --> 00:27:44.251
Is it because you are after
the position of Destroyer?


00:27:44.917 --> 00:27:48.042
What was that? I can't let that slide.


00:27:48.251 --> 00:27:49.417
No, it ain't.


00:27:49.626 --> 00:27:52.251
I don't wanna be anything like that.


00:27:52.459 --> 00:27:54.751
<i>"That"</i> was over the line.


00:27:54.959 --> 00:27:58.292
When I saw how ridiculously strong
the guys in other universes were


00:27:58.501 --> 00:28:01.501
in that all-universe tournament earlier,


00:28:02.542 --> 00:28:04.626
it got me fired...


00:28:04.834 --> 00:28:06.334
...up!


00:28:06.542 --> 00:28:10.667
You mean your sights are
already set on other universes?


00:28:10.876 --> 00:28:13.042
You're as big a buffoon as ever.


00:28:13.251 --> 00:28:17.876
Then Vegeta-<i>san</i>, why do you seek
even greater strength?


00:28:18.084 --> 00:28:19.417
Frieza!


00:28:19.626 --> 00:28:23.334
This dumbass right here
decided to bring that devil


00:28:23.542 --> 00:28:25.459
of all people back to life, that's why!


00:28:25.667 --> 00:28:31.792
Hey, if it wasn't for Frieza,
our 7th Universe might not still be here.


00:28:32.001 --> 00:28:33.584
Oh, is that right?


00:28:33.792 --> 00:28:36.334
Yeah. He helped save us.


00:28:36.542 --> 00:28:40.459
Idiot! He was only thinking
of himself in doing so.


00:28:43.709 --> 00:28:46.584
You saw Frieza when he came
to earth before, remember?


00:28:46.792 --> 00:28:49.792
He accomplished that much
in that short amount of time.


00:28:51.751 --> 00:28:55.917
You're saying he might get even
more powerful and come to defeat us?


00:28:56.126 --> 00:28:57.459
No doubt about it.


00:28:57.667 --> 00:29:02.001
I don't know. Even though we
brought him back to life?


00:29:02.959 --> 00:29:06.834
You idiot! Do you think
he feels obligated to us?!


00:29:07.042 --> 00:29:10.209
How many times are you
gonna call me an idiot?


00:29:11.292 --> 00:29:15.876
As often as I want to, idiot!!


00:29:17.417 --> 00:29:20.251
Hmm? It's Trunks.


00:29:22.459 --> 00:29:23.659
What is it?


00:29:25.876 --> 00:29:28.667
It looks like a burglar
broke into your lab.


00:29:28.876 --> 00:29:31.167
Huh? What was stolen?


00:29:31.376 --> 00:29:33.334
I'll check the security video.


00:29:33.542 --> 00:29:34.876
Let's see...


00:29:36.626 --> 00:29:38.959
The Dragon Balls that you collected


00:29:39.167 --> 00:29:41.459
and the Dragon Radar.


00:29:41.667 --> 00:29:43.792
They took what?!


00:29:45.126 --> 00:29:48.626
Like I told you, you need better security.


00:29:48.834 --> 00:29:50.917
You know what, Mama?


00:29:51.126 --> 00:29:53.292
The burglars that show up--


00:29:54.584 --> 00:29:57.292
they were wearing clothes like Papa's.


00:29:59.292 --> 00:30:00.584
Huh?!


00:30:05.209 --> 00:30:07.251
Thank you, Trunks.


00:30:08.292 --> 00:30:10.209
The culprits are Frieza's men.


00:30:10.417 --> 00:30:12.709
He deliberately used some men
with lower battle powers


00:30:12.917 --> 00:30:15.251
so we wouldn't notice them.


00:30:15.459 --> 00:30:19.626
Frieza sure is relentless in
going after the Dragon Balls.


00:30:19.834 --> 00:30:23.792
I wonder what sort of wish
he could have at this point.


00:30:24.001 --> 00:30:27.001
He ain't able to wish for anything
beyond Shenron's power,


00:30:27.209 --> 00:30:30.459
so wishing to be made the strongest
in the universe is out.


00:30:30.667 --> 00:30:34.459
That should be obvious;
his wish is to never die.


00:30:34.667 --> 00:30:35.459
Yeah, but,


00:30:35.667 --> 00:30:38.959
not dying is pointless if you still lose.


00:30:39.167 --> 00:30:43.626
Even so, there's a chance that
someday, he'll surpass us!


00:30:43.834 --> 00:30:45.334
There is?


00:30:46.917 --> 00:30:50.459
I had six of the Dragon Balls.


00:30:50.667 --> 00:30:54.001
They're sure to go where
the last one is to find it.


00:30:54.209 --> 00:30:55.209
Where is it?


00:30:55.292 --> 00:30:56.709
The ice continent.


00:30:56.917 --> 00:30:59.834
I don't like the cold, so I was
putting off going to get it.


00:31:00.042 --> 00:31:01.917
The ice continent?


00:31:03.042 --> 00:31:04.709
Would you like to come, too?


00:31:04.917 --> 00:31:07.376
Hmph, I'm taking a nap.


00:31:07.584 --> 00:31:11.042
Oh, my, does that not sound like fun?


00:31:11.251 --> 00:31:12.751
Anything good to eat there?


00:31:12.959 --> 00:31:14.876
I wouldn't count on it.


00:31:15.084 --> 00:31:16.959
Then count me out.


00:31:17.751 --> 00:31:19.709
Terrific! Then here,


00:31:19.917 --> 00:31:21.751
look after Bulla.


00:31:21.959 --> 00:31:24.626
Thank you!


00:31:24.834 --> 00:31:27.626
Hey! Why, you...!


00:31:31.417 --> 00:31:34.209
The ice continent is cold.


00:31:36.209 --> 00:31:38.626
We'll have to buy some
cold-weather gear on the way.


00:31:38.834 --> 00:31:42.167
Why were you collecting the Dragon Balls?


00:31:43.459 --> 00:31:45.251
Never you mind.


00:31:45.459 --> 00:31:47.001
Tell me!


00:31:49.126 --> 00:31:53.417
I was going to make myself younger.
About five years' worth.


00:31:53.626 --> 00:31:56.834
You were gonna use the Dragon Balls
for something that unimportant?!


00:31:57.042 --> 00:32:01.084
You hush! You Saiyans wouldn't understand!


00:32:01.292 --> 00:32:02.376
Hmph.


00:32:02.584 --> 00:32:06.626
Why only five years? Why not any longer?


00:32:06.834 --> 00:32:09.584
It would seem unnatural to become
young again all at once, right?!


00:32:09.792 --> 00:32:12.084
I'm sure people would say...


00:32:12.292 --> 00:32:17.626
"Oh? Bulma-<i>san</i>, you suddenly
look young again, don't you?


00:32:17.834 --> 00:32:22.501
I wonder, have you had some work done?"


00:32:22.709 --> 00:32:24.292
...and so forth.


00:32:24.501 --> 00:32:28.584
Hold on. You've <i>already</i> been using
the Dragon Balls from time to time, huh?


00:32:54.584 --> 00:32:56.126
Frieza-<i>sama,</i>


00:32:56.334 --> 00:32:59.042
along with the Dragon Radar,


00:32:59.251 --> 00:33:03.626
Vegeta's wife was already in possession
of six of the Dragon Balls,


00:33:03.834 --> 00:33:05.542
so our search team obtained them,


00:33:05.751 --> 00:33:09.501
and they are now heading to the site
of the last one to locate it.


00:33:09.709 --> 00:33:12.292
That is marvelous news.


00:33:12.501 --> 00:33:16.709
So, shall we start up the ship
and head for earth?


00:33:16.917 --> 00:33:21.251
No, we can do that once they
find all seven Dragon Balls.


00:33:21.459 --> 00:33:24.167
It would be dangerous to rush there
and arrive too early.


00:33:24.376 --> 00:33:30.042
Even without Scouters, they can tell
if a high battle power is approaching.


00:33:32.417 --> 00:33:34.042
Understood.


00:33:34.251 --> 00:33:37.376
You have written down
how to make the wish, yes?


00:33:37.584 --> 00:33:39.959
Yes, to the letter.


00:33:40.167 --> 00:33:42.084
By the way...


00:33:42.292 --> 00:33:43.751
What is it, Kikono?


00:33:43.959 --> 00:33:50.292
N-Nothing... just... once
the Dragon Balls are gathered,


00:33:50.501 --> 00:33:56.084
I was wondering, Frieza-<i>sama</i>,
what sort of wish would you be making?


00:33:56.292 --> 00:33:59.751
Would it be to have an immortal body,
as you have mentioned before?


00:34:01.501 --> 00:34:02.584
No, it would not.


00:34:02.792 --> 00:34:03.834
Huh?


00:34:05.126 --> 00:34:07.709
I realized something
when I was in earth's hell


00:34:07.917 --> 00:34:10.209
and rendered unable to move--


00:34:10.417 --> 00:34:12.376
that not being able to either die or move


00:34:12.584 --> 00:34:14.709
was nothing but misery.


00:34:14.917 --> 00:34:18.876
Then... perhaps,


00:34:19.084 --> 00:34:24.209
to not ever take any damage...
or something?


00:34:24.417 --> 00:34:28.667
That would make the game no fun to play.


00:34:28.876 --> 00:34:32.834
Hmm... What could it be...?


00:34:34.667 --> 00:34:36.042
You will never guess.


00:34:36.251 --> 00:34:40.876
You wish to increase your height, correct?


00:34:41.501 --> 00:34:45.876
Huh?! B-Berryblue-san!
How could you say that?!


00:34:46.084 --> 00:34:48.709
There are so many soldiers
who have called Frieza-<i>sama</i>


00:34:48.917 --> 00:34:53.709
a "pipsqueak" behind his back
who have been eliminated, after all.


00:34:53.917 --> 00:34:56.709
Well deduced, Berryblue-<i>san</i>.


00:34:57.501 --> 00:34:59.084
You are correct.


00:34:59.292 --> 00:35:00.501
Huh?!


00:35:01.459 --> 00:35:03.501
That was the right answer?!


00:35:03.709 --> 00:35:06.501
Can you promise not to tell anyone?


00:35:06.709 --> 00:35:09.126
O-Of course!


00:35:10.042 --> 00:35:12.542
I would like...


00:35:12.751 --> 00:35:16.792
...to grow by about... five centimeters.


00:35:17.001 --> 00:35:18.626
Huh?!


00:35:18.834 --> 00:35:20.542
Th-Then,


00:35:20.751 --> 00:35:24.209
if you adopted your second transformation,


00:35:24.417 --> 00:35:26.834
would that not be sufficiently tall?


00:35:27.042 --> 00:35:33.751
Oh, no! I wish to be taller
in my regular and final forms.


00:35:33.959 --> 00:35:38.251
Then, why only a mere five centimeters?


00:35:38.459 --> 00:35:43.501
It would seem unnatural to become
tall all at once, right?!


00:35:45.376 --> 00:35:49.417
I want it to look like I am still growing.


00:35:49.626 --> 00:35:54.334
I-I see...


00:36:01.042 --> 00:36:04.251
There's nobody around here.


00:36:04.459 --> 00:36:09.376
There just aren't that many folks
with a battle power of at least 1,000.


00:36:09.584 --> 00:36:10.876
What choice do we have?


00:36:11.084 --> 00:36:14.209
Our orders were to go find as
many combatants as we could


00:36:14.417 --> 00:36:16.209
to rebuild the force.


00:36:16.417 --> 00:36:18.459
There already were a bunch
of combatants, weren't there?


00:36:18.667 --> 00:36:21.167
Rumor has it that they were
fighting too timidly,


00:36:21.376 --> 00:36:24.334
so Frieza-<i>sama</i> killed them all.


00:36:25.417 --> 00:36:26.251
Tch.


00:36:26.459 --> 00:36:29.584
Cheelai, why did you join the Frieza force?


00:36:30.334 --> 00:36:33.959
It got out that I stole
a Galactic Patrol spaceship.


00:36:34.167 --> 00:36:37.876
They can't touch me if I'm
in the Frieza force, right?


00:36:38.084 --> 00:36:38.751
You're scum.


00:36:38.959 --> 00:36:41.042
Yeah, well...


00:36:41.251 --> 00:36:43.876
Lemo-<i>san</i>, you've been in the Frieza
force the whole time, right?


00:36:44.084 --> 00:36:46.209
Have you ever met Frieza-<i>sama?</i>


00:36:46.417 --> 00:36:50.751
I'm not a combatant; I've only ever
seen him on the station.


00:36:50.959 --> 00:36:52.584
I hear he's teeny.


00:36:53.584 --> 00:36:58.459
Don't ever say anything like that again.
Not if you want to live.


00:36:58.667 --> 00:37:00.042
All right.


00:37:00.251 --> 00:37:03.376
He's killed some people before
just for having bad breath.


00:37:03.584 --> 00:37:06.501
Still, if he's putting women
and old men to work,


00:37:06.709 --> 00:37:09.459
the Frieza force might have
just about had it, huh?


00:37:11.834 --> 00:37:13.167
What's that?


00:37:13.376 --> 00:37:14.584
A distress signal!


00:37:14.792 --> 00:37:18.501
What's more, it's an awfully
old type of Frieza force signal.


00:37:18.709 --> 00:37:20.109
It's coming from that world over there.


00:37:20.167 --> 00:37:23.626
If we rescue them,
we may get a special bonus.


00:37:24.542 --> 00:37:26.917
All right, let's get down there!


00:37:34.209 --> 00:37:35.309
There's no one here.


00:37:35.334 --> 00:37:36.501
There, you see?


00:37:36.709 --> 00:37:38.751
I'll try using my Scouter.


00:37:42.667 --> 00:37:44.376
Are you the Frieza force?


00:37:51.459 --> 00:37:56.667
Is that a tail?
That means, y-you're a Saiyan!


00:37:56.876 --> 00:37:58.334
"Saiyan"?


00:37:59.501 --> 00:38:04.334
Yeah. I'm Paragus.
I'm a Frieza force Saiyan.


00:38:04.542 --> 00:38:06.042
So that distress signal...


00:38:06.251 --> 00:38:09.959
Yeah, that was me.
My spaceship broke down.


00:38:11.001 --> 00:38:18.084
I've waited an unbelievably long time,
and now, I'm saved!


00:38:18.792 --> 00:38:22.167
Battle power 4,200. Great.


00:38:22.376 --> 00:38:23.709
Are you alone?


00:38:23.917 --> 00:38:25.334
No, there's one other--


00:38:32.001 --> 00:38:35.167
Broly!!


00:38:49.542 --> 00:38:52.376
This is my son, Broly.


00:38:54.792 --> 00:38:56.251
N-No way!


00:38:56.459 --> 00:38:57.268
What?


00:38:57.334 --> 00:39:01.792
H-His battle power is... b-beyond measure!


00:39:02.001 --> 00:39:05.834
Hmm? Ridiculous. That's not possible--


00:39:08.209 --> 00:39:11.459
Hop in! Frieza-<i>sama</i> will be delighted!


00:39:17.209 --> 00:39:21.001
Let's see... What was your name again?


00:39:21.209 --> 00:39:22.584
Broly.


00:39:24.001 --> 00:39:25.959
You want one of these, Broly?


00:39:26.167 --> 00:39:29.709
They're good. Here.


00:39:32.459 --> 00:39:35.167
You have to unwrap it first!


00:39:39.209 --> 00:39:40.959
Eat it, Broly.


00:39:46.751 --> 00:39:49.876
Ha-ha! Well? It's good, right?


00:39:51.042 --> 00:39:53.709
What, not even a thank you?


00:39:53.917 --> 00:39:56.751
Tell her thanks, Broly.


00:39:56.959 --> 00:39:59.501
Thank you... very much.


00:39:59.709 --> 00:40:03.584
That's formal. Just "thank you" is fine.


00:40:03.792 --> 00:40:07.334
Th-Thank you.


00:40:07.542 --> 00:40:08.626
Sure!


00:40:11.792 --> 00:40:14.709
I have brought them, Frieza-<i>sama.</i>


00:40:14.917 --> 00:40:16.792
Ho...


00:40:17.917 --> 00:40:21.542
Are you really a Saiyan?


00:40:24.667 --> 00:40:27.042
You do not appear to have a tail.


00:40:27.251 --> 00:40:28.251
No, sir.


00:40:28.417 --> 00:40:32.792
The effects of transforming into
a Great Ape, which is a Saiyan trait,


00:40:33.001 --> 00:40:35.292
caused him to lose all sense of himself.


00:40:35.501 --> 00:40:37.876
Which is why I cut off his tail.


00:40:38.084 --> 00:40:41.709
Has he lost his sense of himself since?


00:40:41.917 --> 00:40:44.042
Yes, sir, on rare occasions.


00:40:44.251 --> 00:40:47.709
So you are saying that it does
sometimes still happen?


00:40:47.917 --> 00:40:52.001
P-Please do not worry. When that happens...


00:40:52.209 --> 00:40:57.084
...using this remote control, electricity
runs through the device around Broly's neck.


00:40:57.292 --> 00:41:00.917
It is not a strong current,
but it allows me to control him.


00:41:01.126 --> 00:41:02.959
I see.


00:41:04.626 --> 00:41:06.917
What is your name?


00:41:10.334 --> 00:41:12.292
It is Broly, sir.


00:41:14.167 --> 00:41:19.001
I see you still have a tremendous level
of yet-untapped battle power.


00:41:19.209 --> 00:41:24.584
I am certain that he can be of
great use to you, Frieza-<i>sama</i>.


00:41:24.792 --> 00:41:27.709
This is indeed an unexpected bounty.


00:41:27.917 --> 00:41:32.959
Berryblue-<i>san</i>, please offer a reward
to the two who found him.


00:41:35.459 --> 00:41:37.292
Th-This much?!


00:41:37.501 --> 00:41:39.667
--Thank you very much!
--Thank you very much!


00:41:41.001 --> 00:41:43.617
I understand that you were unable
to escape from that barren planet


00:41:43.626 --> 00:41:46.209
for quite a long time.


00:41:46.417 --> 00:41:47.459
Yes, sir.


00:41:47.667 --> 00:41:54.334
Are you aware that your home world
of Planet Vegeta is no longer there?


00:41:54.542 --> 00:42:01.209
Yes, sir. I heard so on the way here.
But none of that matters now.


00:42:01.417 --> 00:42:02.751
It's just...


00:42:02.959 --> 00:42:05.334
Vengeance, yes?


00:42:07.834 --> 00:42:13.917
Paragus-<i>san</i>, did you know that
King Vegeta's son, Vegeta IV,


00:42:14.126 --> 00:42:15.709
is still alive?


00:42:15.917 --> 00:42:18.126
Wh-What?!


00:42:18.334 --> 00:42:20.251
Prince Vegeta?!


00:42:20.459 --> 00:42:24.334
Why... that miserable Vegeta...!


00:42:25.126 --> 00:42:28.959
Allow me to lend you some assistance
with your vengeance.


00:42:30.001 --> 00:42:33.876
Berryblue-<i>san</i>, once these two
have had a shower,


00:42:34.084 --> 00:42:37.001
please arrange for some
battle uniforms for them.


00:42:38.126 --> 00:42:39.542
Yes, sir.


00:42:42.459 --> 00:42:47.834
I had not meant to fight this
time, but now...


00:42:48.042 --> 00:42:51.792
This is starting to get interesting.


00:42:59.251 --> 00:43:00.417
Yo!


00:43:00.626 --> 00:43:02.667
You're looking freshly
scrubbed, aren't you?


00:43:02.876 --> 00:43:04.376
Come eat with us.


00:43:04.584 --> 00:43:07.376
Broly, where's your battle uniform?


00:43:07.917 --> 00:43:10.709
It's... hard to move in it.


00:43:10.917 --> 00:43:13.001
It's not once you put it on.


00:43:13.209 --> 00:43:16.001
Do whatever you like, though.


00:43:16.209 --> 00:43:19.459
But get rid of that fur around your waist.


00:43:19.667 --> 00:43:21.917
It's dirty, and it stinks.


00:43:22.917 --> 00:43:23.959
No!


00:43:26.834 --> 00:43:31.084
O-Oh, so it's something important to you.


00:43:34.251 --> 00:43:36.542
This... is my--


00:43:36.751 --> 00:43:38.917
Broly, we're here to eat,


00:43:39.126 --> 00:43:40.917
not to talk.


00:43:44.042 --> 00:43:46.667
You can at least let him
talk that much, can't you?


00:43:46.876 --> 00:43:49.334
I'd appreciate it if you didn't butt in.


00:43:49.917 --> 00:43:50.726
Huh?!


00:43:50.834 --> 00:43:51.917
Now, now...


00:43:52.126 --> 00:43:53.042
Hey,


00:43:53.251 --> 00:43:55.459
are you new?


00:43:57.084 --> 00:44:00.709
It can't be any fun hanging out
with this sour bunch.


00:44:00.917 --> 00:44:04.626
I'm the only combatant aboard
this ship for this operation


00:44:04.834 --> 00:44:06.917
who's any good.


00:44:07.917 --> 00:44:09.042
Come on over with me.


00:44:09.251 --> 00:44:13.167
Let go of me! I told you no, didn't I?!


00:44:13.376 --> 00:44:15.834
How about if I buy you a drink?


00:44:16.042 --> 00:44:17.751
Shut up, old man!


00:44:21.084 --> 00:44:22.292
Stop, Broly!


00:44:22.501 --> 00:44:25.667
What do you want?
You got a problem with me?


00:44:27.917 --> 00:44:28.820
I do.


00:44:28.959 --> 00:44:31.542
What did you say?!


00:44:31.751 --> 00:44:34.876
Wha--?! Damn it! Damn it!


00:44:35.834 --> 00:44:36.917
Broly!


00:45:02.917 --> 00:45:04.501
Are you okay?!


00:45:05.917 --> 00:45:06.917
You!


00:45:07.042 --> 00:45:10.167
You went too far!
How could you do that to him?!


00:45:10.376 --> 00:45:13.626
If I hadn't stopped him,
he might have killed him.


00:45:13.834 --> 00:45:17.042
Just how did you raise him?


00:45:17.251 --> 00:45:21.334
Hmph, while we are in your debt,
we don't seem to see eye to eye.


00:45:21.542 --> 00:45:24.001
From now on, please do not
come near my son.


00:45:26.417 --> 00:45:27.417
Tch.


00:45:29.292 --> 00:45:30.542
Paragus-<i>san</i>,


00:45:30.751 --> 00:45:32.959
Frieza-<i>sama</i> is calling for you.


00:45:33.167 --> 00:45:36.709
Frieza-<i>sama?</i> Yes, we will
come right away. Broly!


00:45:36.917 --> 00:45:39.667
No, just you, Paragus-<i>san.</i>


00:45:39.876 --> 00:45:42.167
Huh? Oh, I see.


00:45:42.376 --> 00:45:45.376
Broly, I'll be right back. Wait here.


00:45:46.542 --> 00:45:50.584
My dead creep of a father
might be better than this guy.


00:45:51.667 --> 00:45:52.667
Huh?


00:45:56.626 --> 00:45:58.876
Oh, you swiped that?


00:45:59.084 --> 00:46:01.792
This is what I think of this thing!


00:46:06.709 --> 00:46:09.584
Broly, thank you for earlier.


00:46:15.334 --> 00:46:19.001
Oh, you want some water?
Let me have that.


00:46:22.542 --> 00:46:23.626
Here.


00:46:29.584 --> 00:46:31.626
What is this?


00:46:31.834 --> 00:46:34.001
Huh? It's ordinary water.


00:46:34.209 --> 00:46:37.167
Haven't you ever had water before?


00:46:47.292 --> 00:46:49.042
That was good.


00:46:51.667 --> 00:46:54.084
This is Ba's ear.


00:46:55.001 --> 00:46:57.417
Oh, you mean the fur?


00:46:57.626 --> 00:47:01.334
Me and Ba got along well.


00:47:01.542 --> 00:47:06.209
Ba is a big, big, beast,
bigger than this ship.


00:47:06.417 --> 00:47:10.376
"Ba" is the sound Ba made,
so that's what I called Ba.


00:47:10.584 --> 00:47:12.126
Ba was scary,


00:47:12.334 --> 00:47:18.626
but day after day, while doing
training by dodging Ba's attacks,


00:47:18.834 --> 00:47:21.126
we became friends.


00:47:21.334 --> 00:47:23.709
We became good friends.


00:47:30.667 --> 00:47:33.501
So Ba was the first friend you ever made.


00:47:33.709 --> 00:47:41.292
But Dad was angry. Being friends
with Ba isn't training. So then...


00:47:43.292 --> 00:47:48.292
Dad shot Ba's ear with a gun,
making Ba angry.


00:47:48.501 --> 00:47:52.376
Ba never became friends with me again.


00:47:53.334 --> 00:47:58.126
That's why I decided to stay with Ba's ear.


00:48:01.251 --> 00:48:03.542
You sure talked a lot, Broly.


00:48:03.751 --> 00:48:08.209
This is the first time I've ever heard
such a pure story around here.


00:48:08.417 --> 00:48:11.751
You seriously are innocent.


00:48:11.959 --> 00:48:16.042
I'll bet you don't even like to
fight, do you?


00:48:17.459 --> 00:48:20.334
You just had an incredible gift
for rough-and-tumble fighting,


00:48:20.542 --> 00:48:23.959
so your old man forced you
to train, didn't he?


00:48:24.167 --> 00:48:26.167
That father of yours!


00:48:26.376 --> 00:48:30.459
He only thinks of you as
a powerful weapon, doesn't he?


00:48:30.667 --> 00:48:32.917
One used for vengeance and getting ahead.


00:48:33.126 --> 00:48:37.251
Probably. Your old man is the worst.


00:48:37.459 --> 00:48:40.501
You don't have to do everything
that guy tells you.


00:48:43.459 --> 00:48:47.126
It's not right for you to say
bad things about Dad.


00:48:53.251 --> 00:48:55.334
It should be around here somewhere...


00:48:57.459 --> 00:48:59.709
You dumbass! Hurry and pull me up!


00:48:59.917 --> 00:49:01.251
Sorry!


00:49:08.626 --> 00:49:10.542
Found it! I found it!


00:49:13.292 --> 00:49:15.542
The planet called earth
to which we are about to go


00:49:15.751 --> 00:49:18.876
will have Vegeta and one other Saiyan.


00:49:19.084 --> 00:49:22.251
I would like to see Broly-<i>san</i>'s power.


00:49:22.459 --> 00:49:26.042
The innate strength that Broly
possesses is super-prodigious.


00:49:26.251 --> 00:49:28.876
We will achieve our long-sought vengeance!


00:49:29.084 --> 00:49:33.459
Incidentally, you are free to do
with Vegeta whatever you wish...


00:49:34.667 --> 00:49:40.751
But please allow me to finish off
the other Saiyan named Son Goku.


00:49:40.959 --> 00:49:46.376
Killing Son Goku has long been
a dream of mine, you see!


00:49:47.459 --> 00:49:49.376
As you wish.


00:49:49.584 --> 00:49:53.459
Frieza-<i>sama</i>, we have collected
all seven Dragon Balls!


00:49:53.667 --> 00:49:56.167
Oh, that is outstanding!


00:50:07.917 --> 00:50:09.917
Down there! Frieza's men!


00:50:10.126 --> 00:50:13.042
Tch, they've already found the last one?


00:50:14.834 --> 00:50:17.167
That aircraft looks like
trouble, doesn't it?


00:50:17.376 --> 00:50:20.459
Could those be the Saiyans that
Kikono-<i>sama</i> warned us about?


00:50:22.917 --> 00:50:25.709
Whoo! Now this is cold!


00:50:25.917 --> 00:50:27.837
Whis-<i>san</i>, I'm surprised
it doesn't bother you.


00:50:27.917 --> 00:50:31.334
The vacuum of space is even colder.


00:50:34.417 --> 00:50:35.309
Y-Yikes!


00:50:35.417 --> 00:50:38.751
The Scouter's readings just spiked!
It's the Saiyans!


00:50:38.959 --> 00:50:40.376
We're getting out of here!


00:50:50.959 --> 00:50:51.894
Hey, you!


00:50:51.959 --> 00:50:54.459
Come on out and give back the Dragon Balls!


00:50:56.167 --> 00:50:57.209
Wh-What do we do?


00:50:57.417 --> 00:51:01.126
Wh-What do we do?
If we don't give them back,


00:51:01.334 --> 00:51:03.542
he'll kill us.


00:51:04.626 --> 00:51:08.292
If we <i>do</i> give them back,
Frieza-<i>sama</i> will kill us!


00:51:29.792 --> 00:51:30.792
Well, well,


00:51:30.876 --> 00:51:32.792
here comes Frieza's entrance.


00:51:33.001 --> 00:51:35.667
Hmm? What's that?


00:51:35.876 --> 00:51:39.126
It ain't just Frieza. There's some other...


00:51:39.334 --> 00:51:41.376
...out-of-this-world guy in there.


00:52:11.334 --> 00:52:13.417
Those are Saiyans, aren't they?


00:52:19.209 --> 00:52:22.292
Vegeta! There's no doubt about it.


00:52:25.167 --> 00:52:27.167
He looks just like the king.


00:52:30.959 --> 00:52:33.376
What are you doing here, Frieza?


00:52:33.584 --> 00:52:35.501
I am sure you already know.


00:52:35.709 --> 00:52:39.334
Having a wish granted by the Dragon Balls.


00:52:43.959 --> 00:52:45.834
What are those ball-like things?


00:52:46.042 --> 00:52:47.042
Beats me.


00:52:47.167 --> 00:52:49.042
Go ask someone.


00:52:49.584 --> 00:52:53.167
Hey! Go get the Dragon Balls back!


00:52:53.376 --> 00:52:55.584
It appears that we have a larger problem.


00:52:55.792 --> 00:52:56.531
Huh?


00:52:56.584 --> 00:53:00.876
I suppose you might call it
the nature of their warrior race.


00:53:01.084 --> 00:53:03.334
Frieza, who are those two?


00:53:03.542 --> 00:53:06.376
These are the newest enlistees
to the Frieza force,


00:53:06.584 --> 00:53:10.084
Broly-<i>san</i> and his father...


00:53:10.292 --> 00:53:11.417
...Paragus!


00:53:11.626 --> 00:53:17.501
There you have it. As you appear to have
noticed, they, like you, are Saiyans.


00:53:17.709 --> 00:53:19.501
I don't know them.


00:53:19.709 --> 00:53:23.334
I understand that when you were
quite little, your father, King Vegeta,


00:53:23.542 --> 00:53:28.417
did a terrible disservice to
Paragus-<i>san</i> and Broly-<i>san</i>, here,


00:53:28.626 --> 00:53:34.209
and up until now, they were trapped
on an unfamiliar, inimical world.


00:53:40.376 --> 00:53:41.876
Frieza!


00:53:44.167 --> 00:53:45.959
What's "inimical"?


00:53:49.001 --> 00:53:51.667
It means "beyond severe."


00:53:52.501 --> 00:53:53.501
Thanks.


00:53:53.667 --> 00:53:55.126
You idiot!


00:53:56.334 --> 00:54:00.501
I swear that you, at least,
will pay for that, Vegeta!


00:54:01.667 --> 00:54:04.417
We are here to take revenge!


00:54:05.917 --> 00:54:08.626
Don't be ridiculous!
How is that any of my affair?


00:54:08.834 --> 00:54:10.626
He ain't got nothing to do with that!


00:54:10.834 --> 00:54:12.542
We're all Saiyans here.


00:54:12.751 --> 00:54:14.459
Let's just get along.


00:54:18.751 --> 00:54:20.417
Frieza-<i>sama?</i>


00:54:24.334 --> 00:54:27.751
He appears unable to wait. Very well.


00:54:27.959 --> 00:54:31.376
Please show me what he has.


00:54:31.834 --> 00:54:33.751
Understood, sir.


00:54:33.959 --> 00:54:35.834
All right! Broly!


00:54:36.042 --> 00:54:37.334
Do it!


00:54:58.667 --> 00:55:02.417
You're not bad, huh?
I'm finally starting to warm up!


00:55:16.501 --> 00:55:17.542
He's fast!


00:55:18.501 --> 00:55:21.542
He must have studied how to use his power.


00:55:26.751 --> 00:55:30.042
It looks like Vegeta is
fairly well-trained, too.


00:55:30.251 --> 00:55:34.542
They have been through their
own share of battles, after all.


00:55:34.751 --> 00:55:38.167
Moreover, your son seems
yet unaccustomed to this.


00:55:38.376 --> 00:55:41.917
Broly-san has never fought
another person, correct?


00:55:42.126 --> 00:55:44.209
Only simulated fights with me.


00:55:44.417 --> 00:55:49.167
Fighting against someone of your
battle power is all but meaningless.


00:55:50.126 --> 00:55:51.876
Not to worry.


00:55:52.084 --> 00:55:54.334
He is steadily becoming
more familiar with it.


00:56:07.251 --> 00:56:08.751
Good, Broly!


00:56:19.376 --> 00:56:21.584
You're a real pest!


00:56:31.084 --> 00:56:32.292
Hmph.


00:56:50.792 --> 00:56:53.459
Wh-What is that?!


00:56:53.667 --> 00:56:58.792
Oh, is Broly-<i>san</i> not able
to turn Super Saiyan?


00:56:59.001 --> 00:57:03.251
S-Super Saiyan? You don't mean...


00:57:03.459 --> 00:57:04.834
...like the legend?


00:57:36.917 --> 00:57:39.126
What's with this guy?


00:57:45.292 --> 00:57:47.376
He's quick to develop!


00:58:07.001 --> 00:58:11.459
He's awesome! He's starting to
hold his own in his base form!


00:59:04.126 --> 00:59:08.042
I-I never imagined that Vegeta
had improved so much.


00:59:08.251 --> 00:59:10.792
Oh, has he reached his limit already?


00:59:11.001 --> 00:59:13.584
Y-Yes, sir.


00:59:13.792 --> 00:59:15.709
Oh, very well.


00:59:15.917 --> 00:59:18.751
Perhaps we should call it a day.


00:59:18.959 --> 00:59:20.167
Yes, sir.


00:59:26.334 --> 00:59:27.709
What is this?


00:59:30.251 --> 00:59:34.792
N-No! Broly! That's enough for now!


00:59:35.001 --> 00:59:38.126
Stop! Come back!


00:59:46.417 --> 00:59:48.334
I-It's gone!


00:59:48.542 --> 00:59:51.959
My remote control is gone! Oh, no!


00:59:52.167 --> 00:59:56.876
Broly!! I told you to stop!


01:00:00.292 --> 01:00:04.792
Didn't you hear what I said?!


01:00:07.501 --> 01:00:09.084
This is ridiculous.


01:00:09.792 --> 01:00:12.959
S-Stop, Vegeta!!


01:01:08.792 --> 01:01:10.251
No way...


01:01:10.459 --> 01:01:11.262
Wha--?


01:01:11.292 --> 01:01:13.251
Have you ever seen
a Saiyan like this before?


01:01:13.459 --> 01:01:16.626
Hey, did you bring any
senzu beans, Kakarot?!


01:01:16.834 --> 01:01:19.209
No, I didn't!


01:01:19.417 --> 01:01:22.001
This is no time to be playing around.


01:01:47.501 --> 01:01:50.917
Eep! If that had hit the ground...!


01:02:00.501 --> 01:02:01.792
Vegeta!


01:02:08.292 --> 01:02:09.751
What is that?


01:02:09.959 --> 01:02:11.792
Th-That...?


01:02:12.001 --> 01:02:15.042
He seems to have become able to
transform and take on the power


01:02:15.251 --> 01:02:17.959
that Saiyans have when
becoming Great Apes,


01:02:18.167 --> 01:02:22.167
without a Great Ape's lumbering moves,
by remaining in his humanoid form.


01:02:23.626 --> 01:02:25.251
Is there some issue with it?


01:02:25.459 --> 01:02:27.751
Th-The thing is...


01:02:29.959 --> 01:02:34.501
He cannot even control it himself.


01:02:46.667 --> 01:02:48.126
Hey, you!


01:02:52.334 --> 01:02:55.001
I think it's about time you fought me.


01:05:51.209 --> 01:05:52.917
Hey, calm down!


01:06:09.251 --> 01:06:14.042
We all live in peace here on the earth!


01:06:19.751 --> 01:06:24.626
Well, a lot... has happened, but still...


01:06:29.417 --> 01:06:32.084
Whatever the case, you ain't a bad guy.


01:06:32.292 --> 01:06:34.167
I can tell.


01:06:35.959 --> 01:06:40.792
Stop doing this. You don't have to listen
to what those bad guys say.


01:07:20.417 --> 01:07:24.167
Frieza-<i>sama</i>, is it okay
if we back off a little?!


01:07:24.376 --> 01:07:26.959
That would seem to be for the best.


01:07:30.542 --> 01:07:35.251
We will take charge of the Dragon Balls!


01:07:37.042 --> 01:07:43.209
We are now free to watch your
son's exploits without reservation.


01:08:08.792 --> 01:08:12.626
That guy is that phenomenal?


01:08:12.834 --> 01:08:14.584
Still, this...


01:08:14.792 --> 01:08:16.417
...isn't right.


01:08:16.626 --> 01:08:17.709
Yeah.


01:08:22.667 --> 01:08:25.084
It's because of his old man.


01:08:25.292 --> 01:08:26.459
Yeah.


01:08:29.334 --> 01:08:31.542
This is the result of him
taking that sweet Broly


01:08:31.751 --> 01:08:35.584
and raising him to be the kind of warrior
that he wants him to be.


01:08:35.792 --> 01:08:38.417
And now he's snapped.


01:08:40.792 --> 01:08:42.876
I really feel sorry for the guy.


01:08:47.126 --> 01:08:49.459
Oh, if this keeps up...


01:08:49.667 --> 01:08:53.542
...my Broly... will be killed...!


01:08:53.751 --> 01:08:57.292
Oh... it's all over...!


01:10:13.709 --> 01:10:18.959
Well, well, it appears the great
Frieza-<i>sama</i> may not get a chance.


01:10:28.126 --> 01:10:29.126
Son!


01:10:31.292 --> 01:10:32.917
What's happened?


01:10:33.126 --> 01:10:35.876
That isn't just Frieza's <i>Ki.</i>


01:10:36.084 --> 01:10:39.084
Yeah, you're right...


01:10:39.292 --> 01:10:41.626
Sounds like you have your hands full.


01:10:44.042 --> 01:10:46.167
You got that right.


01:10:46.376 --> 01:10:48.417
It's a tremendous <i>Ki.</i>


01:10:48.626 --> 01:10:52.417
Even if I went there,
I'd just be in the way.


01:10:52.626 --> 01:10:56.001
Just stand by there for me.


01:11:00.042 --> 01:11:03.751
I-If things get out of hand, I'll use
Instantaneous Movement to head there.


01:11:11.584 --> 01:11:16.167
If you're saying something like that,
this must be some foe, all right.


01:11:18.834 --> 01:11:20.292
Later.


01:13:14.126 --> 01:13:19.334
P-Perhaps... what King Vegeta said...


01:13:19.542 --> 01:13:21.751
...was true...


01:13:35.667 --> 01:13:39.459
Are you sure that he really has
nothing more this time?


01:13:39.667 --> 01:13:41.084
Y-Yes, sir...


01:13:41.292 --> 01:13:43.584
I see.


01:13:47.126 --> 01:13:49.417
Shall we put that to the test?


01:13:57.501 --> 01:13:58.917
Ahem.


01:13:59.126 --> 01:14:02.626
Broly-<i>san!</i> Look at this!


01:14:03.334 --> 01:14:05.001
Broly-<i>san!</i>


01:14:05.667 --> 01:14:09.751
Your father has been killed!


01:15:02.042 --> 01:15:05.459
Yes! I succeeded!


01:15:52.292 --> 01:15:53.501
Very nice.


01:15:53.709 --> 01:15:56.626
That was the expression I was waiting for.


01:15:58.417 --> 01:16:00.334
What are you dawdling around for?!


01:16:00.542 --> 01:16:01.584
Idiot!


01:16:05.042 --> 01:16:07.501
This is no time to insist on fighting
one-on-one, right?


01:16:07.709 --> 01:16:10.751
I hate to admit it,
but it looks like you're right.


01:16:25.376 --> 01:16:27.001
Let's go, Vegeta!


01:16:28.876 --> 01:16:30.376
Damn it all!


01:16:30.584 --> 01:16:31.917
Gyallic Ho!


01:16:32.126 --> 01:16:33.542
Kamehame...


01:16:33.751 --> 01:16:35.751
Hal!


01:16:47.334 --> 01:16:51.459
J-Just a moment! I am Frieza!


01:16:56.376 --> 01:16:58.334
Vegeta! Now! Over here!


01:16:58.542 --> 01:17:00.001
Wh-What?!


01:17:03.584 --> 01:17:06.667
Hey, what in the world is going on?!


01:17:08.709 --> 01:17:10.001
Let go of me!


01:17:10.209 --> 01:17:12.417
Hurry! I'll explain later.


01:17:12.626 --> 01:17:14.667
Piccolo. Got any senzu?


01:17:14.876 --> 01:17:16.667
No, I don't.


01:17:19.792 --> 01:17:21.376
Hey, Vegeta,


01:17:21.584 --> 01:17:23.501
do you know the technique called Fusion?


01:17:23.709 --> 01:17:28.917
Fusion? Yeah, now that you mention it,
Trunks said something about it.


01:17:29.126 --> 01:17:32.376
Hmm? That technique where you do
absurd moves and merge together?!


01:17:32.584 --> 01:17:35.417
Yeah, we're gonna do "Fu-sion"!


01:17:35.626 --> 01:17:36.876
Don't be ridiculous!


01:17:37.084 --> 01:17:39.792
As if I'd ever merge myself... with you!


01:17:40.001 --> 01:17:42.209
It's just for 30 minutes!


01:17:42.417 --> 01:17:45.251
We've joined together before with
the potara earrings, didn't we?


01:17:45.459 --> 01:17:50.042
We ain't got potaras here,
so Fusion is the only way to beat him!


01:17:50.251 --> 01:17:52.834
Even if we have no choice
but to merge together...


01:17:53.042 --> 01:17:56.542
...are you telling me to do these,
these, and these moves?!


01:17:56.751 --> 01:18:01.209
It's the only way to win!
The earth could be done for!


01:18:01.417 --> 01:18:04.126
Hmph, then that's just fate.


01:18:05.709 --> 01:18:09.251
You're okay with letting
your beloved Bulma die?


01:18:10.542 --> 01:18:14.751
Don't try to embarrass me into it! Tch!


01:18:14.959 --> 01:18:18.334
A-All right. Hurry up and teach it to me!


01:18:35.834 --> 01:18:38.042
You dare to push me...


01:18:38.251 --> 01:18:41.126
...to these lengths, do you?


01:18:41.334 --> 01:18:48.334
Then I will teach you a lesson
in the force of Golden Frieza!


01:18:48.542 --> 01:18:51.209
Fu... sion!


01:18:51.417 --> 01:18:52.792
Ha!!


01:18:53.001 --> 01:18:55.709
What an embarrassing pose...!


01:18:55.917 --> 01:19:00.834
This is Fusion. We ain't got any time.
Come on, let's practice!


01:19:01.042 --> 01:19:03.209
What's wrong, Vegeta?


01:19:03.417 --> 01:19:06.209
I'd rather be dead...


01:19:08.042 --> 01:19:10.584
Fu... sion!


01:19:10.792 --> 01:19:11.959
Ha!!


01:19:26.209 --> 01:19:29.376
Heh-heh, nobody's stronger than me now!


01:19:29.584 --> 01:19:31.542
No good! Your fingers didn't match up!


01:19:31.751 --> 01:19:34.501
Try it again in 30 minutes!


01:19:42.626 --> 01:19:44.292
Fu...


01:19:44.501 --> 01:19:45.501
...sion!


01:19:45.667 --> 01:19:46.876
Ha!!


01:19:51.876 --> 01:19:53.542
Absolutely wrong!


01:19:53.751 --> 01:19:55.834
Your two angles were slightly off!


01:19:56.042 --> 01:19:58.084
Another 30 minutes!


01:20:02.251 --> 01:20:04.334
Fu...


01:20:04.542 --> 01:20:05.584
...sion!


01:20:05.792 --> 01:20:07.001
Ha!!


01:20:26.209 --> 01:20:30.792
Good! Now, get out there
and defeat him... uh...


01:20:31.001 --> 01:20:32.709
...wh-what do I call you?


01:20:32.917 --> 01:20:33.726
Huh?


01:20:33.792 --> 01:20:36.751
Using potaras, it was "Vegetto," wasn't it?


01:20:36.959 --> 01:20:38.376
Okay then, um...


01:20:38.584 --> 01:20:40.542
Forget it! Hurry and go!


01:20:40.751 --> 01:20:45.126
I can't do that. Having a name
would sound cooler, to be sure.


01:20:45.334 --> 01:20:49.459
This time it'll be... um...


01:20:49.667 --> 01:20:51.334
...Gogeta!


01:21:02.084 --> 01:21:03.292
Wonderful!


01:21:03.501 --> 01:21:06.459
What wonderful battle power!


01:21:08.001 --> 01:21:10.417
Wh-Who are you?


01:21:10.626 --> 01:21:13.376
Hmph, I am Gogeta!


01:21:13.584 --> 01:21:16.626
Goku and Vegeta have merged together!


01:21:16.834 --> 01:21:17.917
Merged?


01:21:18.126 --> 01:21:21.959
You've been dead for a long time,
so you wouldn't know.


01:21:22.167 --> 01:21:24.626
Their two strengths are not
just added together;


01:21:24.834 --> 01:21:27.167
they're significantly greater.


01:21:27.376 --> 01:21:29.834
Th-That is not fair!


01:21:30.042 --> 01:21:33.501
You're a fine one to be saying that.


01:21:36.459 --> 01:21:37.417
Hoi!


01:21:38.751 --> 01:21:40.584
Over here!


01:21:43.334 --> 01:21:44.334
Oh, my.


01:21:44.501 --> 01:21:47.292
Whis-<i>san</i>, let me take it from here!


01:21:48.292 --> 01:21:51.751
You two can merge together, I see.


01:21:51.959 --> 01:21:54.751
Ah, it's that Fusion thing!


01:21:59.126 --> 01:22:00.326
Come on!


01:22:24.584 --> 01:22:27.584
Heh-heh-heh, now it's my turn!


01:23:38.209 --> 01:23:40.042
Ha!!


01:24:42.126 --> 01:24:45.459
Broly is going to be finished at this rate!


01:24:45.667 --> 01:24:50.209
He's been turned into nothing but
a fighting machine, thanks to his father.


01:24:50.417 --> 01:24:53.209
He isn't fighting because
he wants to fight!


01:24:53.417 --> 01:24:57.584
Broly is actually a
pure, kindhearted Saiyan!


01:24:57.792 --> 01:24:59.959
We can't let him die!


01:26:14.709 --> 01:26:18.959
I shall grant thee any one wish.


01:26:19.167 --> 01:26:21.334
So, now what do we do?


01:26:21.542 --> 01:26:24.376
Hurry up and tell me!


01:26:24.584 --> 01:26:25.876
Forget it, I'm shooting.


01:26:26.084 --> 01:26:29.042
A-All right! I'll tell you!


01:26:30.792 --> 01:26:33.251
"Just say the wish as-is."


01:26:33.459 --> 01:26:36.959
Oh, is that all?


01:26:39.001 --> 01:26:40.959
My wish is...


01:28:12.959 --> 01:28:15.209
Magnificent!


01:28:15.417 --> 01:28:19.751
This might bring this to a close.


01:28:24.334 --> 01:28:26.334
Ka...


01:28:26.542 --> 01:28:28.709
...me...


01:28:28.917 --> 01:28:30.959
...ha...


01:28:31.167 --> 01:28:34.167
...me...


01:28:36.042 --> 01:28:40.292
Ha!!


01:28:47.667 --> 01:28:48.876
Send Broly...


01:28:49.084 --> 01:28:53.417
...back to the planet where he was before!!


01:29:14.834 --> 01:29:17.709
Your wish has been granted.


01:29:19.126 --> 01:29:21.001
Farewell!


01:29:38.126 --> 01:29:39.876
Get in, Cheelai!


01:29:52.959 --> 01:29:54.376
Whoa, there!


01:30:06.626 --> 01:30:08.792
I will be back, understand?


01:30:20.584 --> 01:30:24.042
Hmph, it looks like it
turned out all right.


01:30:30.126 --> 01:30:33.459
Sorry to get you mixed up in all that.


01:30:33.667 --> 01:30:37.542
Don't worry about it. That was the most
thrilling and enjoyable time I've had


01:30:37.751 --> 01:30:40.042
since I joined the Frieza force.


01:30:41.709 --> 01:30:44.001
Think they'll come after us?


01:30:44.209 --> 01:30:45.917
Who knows?


01:30:47.001 --> 01:30:49.834
So, Cheelai,
where are you planning on going?


01:30:50.042 --> 01:30:51.626
To Broly's world.


01:30:51.834 --> 01:30:53.209
Vampa, huh?


01:30:53.876 --> 01:30:56.292
What world should I let you off on, Lemo?


01:30:56.501 --> 01:31:01.917
Nah, I'll tag along with you.
The risk is the same no matter where I go.


01:31:02.126 --> 01:31:06.542
Being near the mighty Broly
will put me at ease.


01:31:10.792 --> 01:31:14.626
In that case, we'll have to stop along
the way to buy some food and stuff.


01:31:14.626 --> 01:31:16.026
"Three days later"


01:31:16.100 --> 01:31:19.939
Sure enough, it appears that
those two are together with Broly.


01:31:20.126 --> 01:31:23.209
Let us leave them alone for a while.


01:31:23.417 --> 01:31:26.876
We will allow them to bring
Broly's mind under control,


01:31:27.084 --> 01:31:30.001
and once he can release
that immense power


01:31:30.209 --> 01:31:31.834
without losing his sense of self,


01:31:32.042 --> 01:31:35.626
that is when he will become
the mightiest combatant.


01:31:35.834 --> 01:31:38.959
Do you think that will work?


01:31:39.167 --> 01:31:42.251
I certainly hope that it does.


01:31:43.417 --> 01:31:47.584
No matter how hard I try
to raise my battle power,


01:31:47.792 --> 01:31:50.959
my foes are still both Son Goku and Vegeta.


01:31:52.709 --> 01:31:57.626
I would like to have one other, as well.


01:32:00.376 --> 01:32:02.876
"Planetoid Vampa"


01:32:16.501 --> 01:32:20.917
You're kidding, right?
<i>This</i> is what you've been eating?


01:32:21.126 --> 01:32:26.334
W-Well, it's bitter, but it's better
than starving to death... I guess.


01:32:29.334 --> 01:32:31.876
Bleh! C-Count me out.


01:32:32.084 --> 01:32:33.667
Don't ask for too much.


01:32:33.876 --> 01:32:37.709
We won't last even 50 days
on just the food we bought.


01:32:40.042 --> 01:32:41.084
Somebody's here.


01:32:41.292 --> 01:32:42.459
Huh?


01:32:42.667 --> 01:32:44.917
Hey, can I come in?


01:32:48.542 --> 01:32:51.292
Huh? Who are you guys?


01:32:51.501 --> 01:32:54.292
Y-You! You're the Saiyan from earth!


01:32:54.876 --> 01:32:59.209
Oh, right! You're the ones from the
Frieza force who used the Dragon Balls!


01:32:59.417 --> 01:33:02.292
What are you doing here?


01:33:03.834 --> 01:33:05.667
You guys are Broly's friends?


01:33:05.876 --> 01:33:08.001
I asked you what you were doing here!


01:33:08.209 --> 01:33:10.084
Now, don't lose your temper.


01:33:10.292 --> 01:33:12.834
I ain't here to fight, okay?


01:33:13.042 --> 01:33:14.251
Then, why are you here?


01:33:14.459 --> 01:33:19.292
I heard your world was awful,
so I brought you some stuff.


01:33:19.501 --> 01:33:24.001
Who asked you to? Go away.
You can't trick us.


01:33:27.376 --> 01:33:31.251
I asked someone named Bulma,
and got this for you.


01:33:32.709 --> 01:33:34.834
Could you stand back?


01:33:39.709 --> 01:33:44.876
There's food and water and a bunch
of other stuff inside the house.


01:33:48.334 --> 01:33:50.626
Also, these are called senzu beans.


01:33:50.834 --> 01:33:51.959
I'm giving you two of them.


01:33:52.167 --> 01:33:55.292
Eat one whenever you think,
"Yikes, I'm gonna die!"


01:33:55.501 --> 01:33:58.667
They don't work against illnesses,
but they completely heal injuries,


01:33:58.876 --> 01:34:01.376
and restore your strength to full, too.


01:34:01.584 --> 01:34:03.334
What are you plotting?


01:34:03.542 --> 01:34:07.542
It ain't like that. I just want
you to live healthy.


01:34:07.751 --> 01:34:08.751
--Huh?
--Huh?


01:34:08.917 --> 01:34:11.751
I was so sure of my own strength,


01:34:11.959 --> 01:34:15.792
but then the much stronger Broly showed up.


01:34:16.001 --> 01:34:18.042
And what's more, he's a Saiyan,
too, just like me.


01:34:18.251 --> 01:34:20.792
He's probably even stronger
than Beerus-<i>sama</i>.


01:34:21.001 --> 01:34:23.792
Beerus-<i>sama</i> is this god, you see.


01:34:24.001 --> 01:34:25.084
Goodness.


01:34:25.292 --> 01:34:29.459
Anyways, it would be a shame
to let someone so incredible...


01:34:29.667 --> 01:34:31.584
...up and die, right?


01:34:37.376 --> 01:34:41.292
Well, whatever.
Just take care of yourselves.


01:34:41.501 --> 01:34:42.340
Bye.


01:34:42.417 --> 01:34:44.751
Huh? There's no ship.


01:34:44.959 --> 01:34:47.084
How did you get here?


01:34:47.292 --> 01:34:51.334
I can do Instantaneous Movement.
I just searched for Broly's <i>Ki</i>.


01:34:51.542 --> 01:34:55.126
I really don't get
anything you're telling us.


01:34:55.334 --> 01:34:56.751
Is it okay if I come again?


01:34:56.959 --> 01:35:00.667
Just so you know,
you're our enemy, understand?


01:35:00.876 --> 01:35:03.042
We may be out of the Frieza force,


01:35:03.251 --> 01:35:06.251
but we're not becoming friends with you.


01:35:06.459 --> 01:35:08.834
Doesn't matter to me either way.


01:35:09.042 --> 01:35:09.947
Huh?


01:35:10.042 --> 01:35:14.001
I just want you to let me
come fight Broly once in a while.


01:35:14.209 --> 01:35:15.376
--Huh?
--Huh?


01:35:15.584 --> 01:35:19.251
There's some stuff I'd
like to teach him, too.


01:35:20.167 --> 01:35:23.209
You sure do seem to be pretty crazy.


01:35:23.417 --> 01:35:24.417
How come?


01:35:24.626 --> 01:35:29.459
Well, anyway, I should offer
my gratitude. Thank you.


01:35:29.667 --> 01:35:32.501
Yeah. Bye now. I'll be back again.


01:35:32.709 --> 01:35:35.417
We may not be here when you do.


01:35:35.626 --> 01:35:40.084
That's okay. As long as you ain't
too far away, I can find you.


01:35:42.292 --> 01:35:45.167
What's your name?


01:35:47.917 --> 01:35:52.292
Son Goku. Also...


01:35:52.501 --> 01:35:54.209
...Kakarot.

